          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nake asya, Ndwĩvĩtĩla. Na Etomu amumĩlĩla na andũ aingĩ, na kw’oko kwĩ vinya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũu nĩw’o Etomu waleile kũnenga Isilaeli ũthei wa kũvĩtĩla mũvakanĩ wake: kwondũ wa ũu Isilaeli aalũka na aekana nake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
